*   (sigma 901.4 fF, of which 81.195 fF is net-to-net coupling).
*   One star per net: <net> is the hub, <net>__t<k> each device
*   terminal on it, R<net>_t<k> the arm between them.
*   klt 0.6.0, deck gf180mcu,
*   GDS sha256 25943ef873ddc280...
* Net names are the schematic's, restored through klt lvs's own net
*   correspondence -- match, 20/20 nets, every one paired.
*
* NOT FROM THE LAYOUT -- see layout/postlayout/AUDIT.md:
*   2 body/plate net(s) tied to the net the schematic puts
*   them on. The extraction deck's connectivity stack does not reach
*   an Nwell, a substrate ring, a bipolar base well or a MiM plate,
*   so they extract isolated and would otherwise float.
*   No ideal device: every golden device is drawn.
*
.subckt por_output_chain VDD VSS IBIAS POR_RAW RESETn

